    <h1>GTA 6 on PS5 vs <em>PS5 Pro</em>: Performance and Settings</h1>
    <p class="gta-lede"><b>Heads up: I haven't played GTA 6.</b> This isn't my take on how it feels, it's what Rockstar and the outlets who tested it have said, and every section names its source. No spoilers, nothing from the story.</p>
